WEBVTT

00:09:59.581 --> 00:10:00.857
And they didn't reply.

00:10:00.881 --> 00:10:02.431
(Laughter)

00:10:02.455 --> 00:10:04.352
So I changed tack.

00:10:04.376 --> 00:10:07.652
I emailed "Chainsaw Al" Dunlap,

00:10:07.676 --> 00:10:11.215
the asset stripper from the 1990s.

00:10:11.239 --> 00:10:13.446
He would come into failing businesses

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:15.505
and close down 30 percent
of the workforce,

00:10:15.529 --> 00:10:18.673
just turn American towns into ghost towns.

00:10:18.697 --> 00:10:20.150
And I emailed him and I said,

00:10:20.174 --> 00:10:22.968
"I believe you may have
a very special brain anomaly

00:10:22.992 --> 00:10:25.003
that makes you ... special,

00:10:25.027 --> 00:10:29.388
and interested in the predatory
spirit, and fearless.

00:10:29.412 --> 00:10:32.864
Can I come and interview you
about your special brain anomaly?"